   ============================================================================================================================================
verification gate before any patient-specific tool or database query runs.
A good flow is:
Patient starts bot
      ↓
Bot asks patient to share their Telegram phone number
      ↓
Backend checks that phone number against patient database
      ↓
If matched, send OTP to the REGISTERED phone number
      ↓
Patient enters OTP
      ↓
Backend verifies OTP
      ↓
Create short-lived authenticated session
      ↓
Only then allow patient-specific tools
      ↓
Every tool verifies:
Telegram user_id + patient_id + active session

